<title>LATVIA: Latvian Jan 1997 CPI up 1.9 pct m/m, yr/yr 11.4.</title>
<headline>Latvian Jan 1997 CPI up 1.9 pct m/m, yr/yr 11.4.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Latvia was 1.9 percent month-on-month in January for a 11.4 percent year-on-year rise, the statistics office said on Monday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN CONSUMER PRICES     Jan '97    Dec '96  Jan '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)    +1.9	 +0.6     +1.8</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		+11.4	+13.1    +23.2</p>
<p> Index (av 1995=100)	     124.4	122.1    111.7</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom + 371 721 5240</p>
</text>
